        "source program": "소스 프로그램"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:03:00.633101Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:3",
      "source": "The primary label points to the location that triggered the diagnostic.",
